      "text": "Reeder was named after the railroad’s assistant chief engineer, Reeder, when the Chicago, Milwaukee, St. line platted the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
